---
// No global imports to avoid CSS bleeding
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="it">
	<head>
		<meta charset="utf-8" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
		<title>Federico Colombo - Curriculum Vitae</title>
		<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Montserrat:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
		<style>
			:root {
				--cv-primary: #0d6b63; /* Teal */
				--cv-dark: #222222;
				--cv-text: #444444;
				--cv-light: #ffffff;
				--cv-bg: #f5f5f5;
			}
			* {
				box-sizing: border-box;
				margin: 0;
				padding: 0;
			}
			body {
				font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;
				background-color: var(--cv-bg);
				color: var(--cv-text);
				line-height: 1.5;
				-webkit-print-color-adjust: exact;
				print-color-adjust: exact;
			}

			/* Controls for web view */
			.cv-controls {
				text-align: center;
				padding: 20px;
				background-color: #1a1a1a;
				color: white;
				display: flex;
				justify-content: center;
				gap: 20px;
			}
			.cv-controls button, .cv-controls a {
				background-color: var(--cv-primary);
				color: white;
				border: none;
				padding: 10px 20px;
				font-size: 1rem;
				font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;
				cursor: pointer;
				text-decoration: none;
				border-radius: 5px;
				font-weight: 600;
				transition: opacity 0.2s;
			}
			.cv-controls button:hover, .cv-controls a:hover {
				opacity: 0.8;
			}

			/* A4 Container */
			.cv-container {
				width: 210mm;
				min-height: 297mm;
				background: var(--cv-light);
				margin: 40px auto;
				box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
				display: flex;
				overflow: hidden;
				position: relative;
			}
			.cv-container::before {
				content: '';
				position: absolute;
				top: 0;
				bottom: 0;
				left: 0;
				width: 35%;
				background-color: var(--cv-primary);
				z-index: 0;
				-webkit-print-color-adjust: exact;
				print-color-adjust: exact;
			}

			/* Columns */
			.left-column {
				width: 35%;
				background-color: transparent;
				color: var(--cv-light);
				padding: 40px 30px;
				z-index: 1;
			}
			.right-column {
				width: 65%;
				padding: 50px 40px;
				z-index: 1;
			}

			/* Profile Image */
			.profile-pic-container {
				text-align: center;
				margin-bottom: 30px;
			}
			.profile-pic {
				width: 140px;
				height: 140px;
				border-radius: 50%;
				object-fit: cover;
				border: 4px solid var(--cv-light);
				box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
			}

			/* Left Column Sections */
			.left-section-title {
				font-size: 1.1rem;
				font-weight: 600;
				margin-bottom: 15px;
				padding-bottom: 8px;
				border-bottom: 2px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.5);
				letter-spacing: 1px;
				text-transform: uppercase;
				margin-top: 25px;
			}
			
			.left-item {
				margin-bottom: 20px;
			}
			.left-item-title {
				font-size: 1rem;
				font-weight: 600;
				margin-bottom: 5px;
				line-height: 1.2;
			}
			.left-item-subtitle {
				font-size: 0.85rem;
				font-weight: 500;
				margin-bottom: 5px;
				opacity: 0.9;
			}
			.left-item-desc {
				font-size: 0.85rem;
				line-height: 1.4;
				opacity: 0.85;
			}

			.skills-list {
				list-style: none;
				font-size: 0.9rem;
				line-height: 1.6;
			}
			.skills-list li {
				margin-bottom: 3px;
			}

			/* Right Column Header */
			.header-name {
				font-size: 2.4rem;
				font-weight: 400;
				color: var(--cv-dark);
				margin-bottom: 5px;
				letter-spacing: -1px;
				line-height: 1.1;
			}
			.header-title {
				font-size: 1.1rem;
				font-weight: 500;
				color: var(--cv-primary);
				margin-bottom: 20px;
			}
			.contact-info {
				display: flex;
				flex-wrap: wrap;
				gap: 15px;
				font-size: 0.85rem;
				color: var(--cv-text);
				margin-bottom: 35px;
			}
			.contact-item {
				display: flex;
				align-items: center;
				gap: 5px;
			}
			.contact-icon {
				color: #999;
				font-style: normal;
				font-weight: bold;
			}

			/* Right Column Sections */
			.right-section-title {
				font-size: 1.2rem;
				font-weight: 600;
				color: var(--cv-dark);
				margin-bottom: 15px;
				padding-bottom: 5px;
				border-bottom: 1px solid #ccc;
				text-transform: uppercase;
				letter-spacing: 1px;
			}
			.profile-text {
				font-size: 0.9rem;
				line-height: 1.5;
				margin-bottom: 35px;
				text-align: justify;
			}

			/* Experience */
			.experience-item {
				margin-bottom: 25px;
			}
			.experience-header {
				display: flex;
				justify-content: space-between;
				align-items: baseline;
				margin-bottom: 2px;
			}
			.experience-title {
				font-size: 1.1rem;
				font-weight: 600;
				color: var(--cv-dark);
			}
			.experience-date {
				font-size: 0.85rem;
				color: var(--cv-text);
				font-weight: 500;
			}
			.experience-company-location {
				display: flex;
				justify-content: space-between;
				margin-bottom: 10px;
			}
			.experience-company {
				font-size: 0.95rem;
				font-weight: 600;
				color: var(--cv-primary);
				text-transform: uppercase;
				letter-spacing: 1px;
			}
			.experience-location {
				font-size: 0.85rem;
				color: var(--cv-text);
			}
			.experience-desc {
				font-size: 0.9rem;
				line-height: 1.5;
				margin-left: 15px;
			}
			.experience-desc li {
				margin-bottom: 4px;
			}

			/* Print Styles */
			.experience-item, .left-item {
				page-break-inside: avoid;
				break-inside: avoid;
			}
			@media print {
				body {
					background-color: white;
					margin: 0;
					padding: 0;
				}
				.cv-controls {
					display: none !important;
				}
				.cv-container {
					margin: 0;
					box-shadow: none;
					width: 100%;
					height: 100%;
					min-height: 100vh;
				}
				.left-column {
					-webkit-print-color-adjust: exact;
					print-color-adjust: exact;
				}
				@page {
					size: A4;
					margin: 0;
				}
			}

			@media (max-width: 800px) {
				.cv-container {
					width: 100%;
					flex-direction: column;
					margin: 0;
				}
				.cv-container::before {
					display: none;
				}
				.left-column {
					background-color: var(--cv-primary);
				}
				.left-column, .right-column {
					width: 100%;
				}
			}
		</style>
	</head>
	<body>
		<div class="cv-controls">
			<a href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}/Federico Colombo - Curriculum Vitae.pdf`} download="Federico_Colombo_CV.pdf">Scarica PDF</a>
			<a href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}/cv-ats-it`}>📄 Versione ATS</a>
			<a href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}/cv`}>🇬🇧 English Version</a>
			<a href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}`}>Torna al Portfolio</a>
		</div>

		<div class="cv-container">
			<!-- Left Column -->
						<div class="left-column">
				<div class="profile-pic-container">
					<img src={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}/profile.jpeg`} alt="Federico Colombo" class="profile-pic" onerror="this.style.display='none'">
				</div>

				<h2 class="left-section-title">Competenze Core</h2>
				<ul class="skills-list">
					<li><strong>Programmazione:</strong> C++, C#, Python</li>
					<li><strong>Grafica & Shader:</strong> HLSL, GLSL, Compute Shaders, VFX Graph</li>
					<li><strong>Engine & Tool:</strong> Unity (Expert), Unreal Engine 5, Custom OpenGL Frameworks, Blender</li>
					<li><strong>Workflow:</strong> Git, Jira, Project Management, Agile Product Strategy</li>
				</ul>

				<h2 class="left-section-title">Formazione</h2>
				<div class="left-item">
					<h3 class="left-item-title">Laurea Magistrale in Ingegneria del Cinema e dei Mezzi di Comunicazione</h3>
					<div class="left-item-subtitle">Politecnico di Torino | 2024 - 2026</div>
					<p class="left-item-desc">Voto stimato: 106/110.</p>
				</div>
				<div class="left-item">
					<h3 class="left-item-title">Laurea Triennale in Ingegneria del Cinema e dei Mezzi di Comunicazione</h3>
					<div class="left-item-subtitle">Politecnico di Torino | 2021 - 2024</div>
					<p class="left-item-desc">Voto finale: 100/110.</p>
				</div>

				<h2 class="left-section-title">Progetti Personali</h2>
				<div class="left-item">
					<h3 class="left-item-title">Graphics Lab (Custom C++ Engine)</h3>
					<div class="left-item-subtitle">Engine Programmer</div>
					<p class="left-item-desc">
						Sviluppato da zero un framework di rendering 3D in OpenGL e C++ con Deferred Shading, PBR e SPOM.
					</p>
				</div>
				<div class="left-item">
					<h3 class="left-item-title">Awaken Asylum & Nihil</h3>
					<div class="left-item-subtitle">Lead Technical Artist</div>
					<p class="left-item-desc">
						Sviluppato un'esperienza educativa VR e un Metroidvania 2D. Gestito l'intera produzione tecnica.
					</p>
				</div>
				<div class="left-item">
					<h3 class="left-item-title">UE5 Tech Art Pipeline</h3>
					<div class="left-item-subtitle">Tech Art & Procedural Workflows</div>
					<p class="left-item-desc">
						Esplorazione tecnica in UE5 con PCG, logiche in Niagara e integrazione di MetaHumans con fisica del groom personalizzata.
					</p>
				</div>
			</div>

			<!-- Right Column -->
						<div class="right-column">
				<h1 class="header-name" style="white-space: nowrap; font-weight: 600; font-size: 2.4rem; letter-spacing: -1px;">FEDERICO COLOMBO</h1>
				<div class="header-title">Computer Graphics Engineer | Technical Artist | XR Developer</div>
				
				<div class="contact-info">
					<div class="contact-item"><i class="contact-icon">📞</i> +39-3513078191</div>
					<div class="contact-item"><i class="contact-icon">✉️</i> colombofederico28@gmail.com</div>
					<div class="contact-item"><i class="contact-icon">🔗</i> linkedin.com/in/federico-colombo10</div>
					<div class="contact-item"><i class="contact-icon">📍</i> Torino, Italia</div>
				</div>

				<h2 class="right-section-title">Profilo Professionale</h2>
				<p class="profile-text">
					Computer Graphics Engineer e Technical Artist specializzato in rendering real-time, spatial computing (XR) e sviluppo di tool procedurali. Laureato con lode in Ingegneria del Cinema e dei Mezzi di Comunicazione. Profonda esperienza nello sviluppo di motori di rendering custom in C++, ottimizzazione di architetture GPU (HLSL/GLSL) e project management di team multidisciplinari. Attivamente alla ricerca di opportunità per applicare competenze ingegneristiche e di gestione per costruire architetture software scalabili e produzioni interattive ad alta fedeltà visiva.
				</p>

				<h2 class="right-section-title">Esperienza Lavorativa</h2>

				<div class="experience-item">
					<div class="experience-header">
						<h3 class="experience-title">Tesi Magistrale XR - R&D Graphics Programmer</h3>
						<span class="experience-date">03/2026 - Presente</span>
					</div>
					<div class="experience-company-location">
						<span class="experience-company">Lemons in the Room</span>
						<span class="experience-location">Firenze, Italia</span>
					</div>
					<ul class="experience-desc">
						<li>Sviluppato una pipeline Mixed Reality real-time per Meta Quest 3 capace di convertire Depth Maps in geometria continua tramite Compute e Mesh Shaders.</li>
						<li>Progettato un sistema 'context-aware' in grado di eseguire analisi topologica su GPU fusa con dati semantici per la generazione di materiali PBR procedurali.</li>
						<li>Sviluppato un framework custom HLSL di Raymarching per Signed Distance Fields (SDFs), ottimizzando la memoria e i Dynamic Bounding Volumes per garantire 72Hz su hardware mobile.</li>
					</ul>
				</div>

				<div class="experience-item">
					<div class="experience-header">
						<h3 class="experience-title">Technical Artist & Gameplay Programmer</h3>
						<span class="experience-date">01/2025 - Presente</span>
					</div>
					<div class="experience-company-location">
						<span class="experience-company">LEVEL UP LAB</span>
						<span class="experience-location">Torino, Italia</span>
					</div>
					<ul class="experience-desc">
						<li>Programmato le meccaniche core di gameplay in C# (Unity) e progettato l'architettura tecnica per il progetto "Line Operator".</li>
						<li>Operato come Project Manager e Technical Producer, coordinando team multidisciplinari di designer e artisti per supervisionare la visione artistica e la fattibilità tecnica.</li>
						<li>Sviluppato Shader HLSL custom e pipeline di post-processing per definire l'identità visiva unica del gioco.</li>
					</ul>
				</div>
				
				<div class="experience-item">
					<div class="experience-header">
						<h3 class="experience-title">Assistente alla Didattica (GUI)</h3>
						<span class="experience-date">10/2024 - 01/2025</span>
					</div>
					<div class="experience-company-location">
						<span class="experience-company">Politecnico di Torino</span>
						<span class="experience-location">Torino, Italia</span>
					</div>
					<ul class="experience-desc">
						<li>Fornito supporto e tutoraggio agli studenti sui principi di UI/UX e programmazione frontend durante i laboratori settimanali.</li>
						<li>Redatto documentazione tecnica e creato materiale didattico di alta qualità per migliorare la comprensione.</li>
					</ul>
				</div>

				<div class="experience-item">
					<div class="experience-header">
						<h3 class="experience-title">Video Artist</h3>
						<span class="experience-date">09/2023 - 06/2024</span>
					</div>
					<div class="experience-company-location">
						<span class="experience-company">RKH SRL</span>
						<span class="experience-location">Torino, Italia</span>
					</div>
					<ul class="experience-desc">
						<li>Operato macchine da presa professionali (RED, Blackmagic 4K/6K) e assistito il DOP in complessi setup di illuminazione.</li>
						<li>Gestito i flussi di montaggio e post-produzione su DaVinci Resolve per contenuti corporate.</li>
					</ul>
				</div>

			</div>
		</div>
		<script>
			// Safari print fix: force left column to be exactly as tall as right column
			// so the green background spans across all printed pages.
			window.addEventListener('load', () => {
				const rightCol = document.querySelector('.right-column');
				const leftCol = document.querySelector('.left-column');
				if (rightCol && leftCol && window.innerWidth > 800) {
					leftCol.style.minHeight = rightCol.offsetHeight + 'px';
				}
			});
		</script>
	</body>
</html>
